  {
    "annotations": {
      "description": "Alloy has not scraped this Bee node's /metrics for 10 minutes. Without it, the Gnosis RPC error rate cannot be measured at all \u2014 and an unscraped node and a perfectly healthy one look identical on a rate() graph, both being flat at nothing.\n\nUsually means the container is down, or the host is not running the `bee` compose profile.\nCheck: docker compose -f docker-compose.host.yml ps\n\nFull status: {{ if eq $labels.environment \"main\" }}https://provenance-gateway.datafund.io/health{{ else if eq $labels.environment \"development\" }}https://provenance-gateway.dev.datafund.io/health{{ else }}https://provenance-gateway.datafund.io/health (or the .dev. host \u2014 environment label was \"{{ $labels.environment }}\"){{ end }}\n\nShipped paused and unpaused on 2026-08-26 once bee_up was confirmed present for both environments in Grafana Cloud. Before that the series did not exist, and a rule that treats absence as failure would have fired the moment it was provisioned.",
